    {
      "text": "The helmet.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 90905,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768428831466666
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I see the order here on my end. Just to be sure I'm helping you correctly, what specifically is the issue with the helmet? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768428832399999
    },
    {
      "text": "The color is wrong. It's just not what I wanted.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 90905,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768428844399999
    },
    {
